{"asset_key":"ep4/env_story_14301294","episode":"ep4","category":"env_story","story_id":"14301294","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1430129401:1":{"text":"다른 광석은 계속 캐고 있어... 하지만 제일 잘 팔리는 무기는 깊은바위 수정으로 만든 거였단 말이야.","source_cn":"其他矿石的挖掘没有停过……但之前销量最好的武器，可都是...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9C7E36F94007CDCB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1430129402:1":{"text":"깊은바위 수정으로 만든 특별한 무기가 없으면, 우리가 만든 평범한 무기는 팔리지 않을 거야. 그러면 광부들의 급여도 줄어들겠지!","source_cn":"没了深晶岩制作的特殊武器，我们制作的普通武器很可能滞销...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xABD43893CB0EB056","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1430129403:1":{"text":"그럼 내 공방은 대체 언제 차리냐고!","source_cn":"这样下去，我什么时候才能存够开工坊的钱！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x717430B09DC98AE6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:矿工奥多":{"text":"광부 오드","source":"矿工奥多","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":4,"localized_text_count":3,"speaker_count":1}}